*** TODO MiniMax M2

MiniMax emerged as a strong player in 2026, with their primary differentiating factor being very low activation parameters. This paper can be found [[https://arxiv.org/abs/2605.26494][here]]. It came out on May 26, 2026.

They got a pretty nice result with their model, but they are mostly following others: fine-grained experts, multi-head attention, GQA, collecting PRs from github, etc. Where they differ from other labs is their RL Objective trick, which got some attention e.g. in Meta's [[https://arxiv.org/pdf/2510.13786][The Art of Sacling RL Compute for LLMs]]. At the moment, MiniMax is really the only lab known to be using CISPO, but it's an interesting footnote.

